---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Exit codes" current="/reference/exit-codes/">
  <article class="doc">
    <header class="doc-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Reference</span>
      <h1>Exit codes</h1>
      <p class="lead">dollarlint uses small, predictable exit codes so CI jobs can distinguish validation failures from command failures.</p>
    </header>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Code</th>
          <th>Meaning</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><code>0</code></td>
          <td>No non-ignored issues were found.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><code>1</code></td>
          <td>Validation, schema loading, or parsing issues were found.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><code>2</code></td>
          <td>The command or configuration could not be used.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="warning">
      <p>Use <code>--schema-store-failure error</code> when catalog availability should fail the run instead of becoming a warning.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</DocsLayout>
